; GoldHEN plugins.ini  (copy to /data/GoldHEN/plugins.ini on the PS4)
;
; Lines under [default] load for EVERY game. Recommended: use a section for
; one specific game instead (replace CUSA00000 with that game's title ID):
;
;   [CUSA00000]
;   /data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_series.prx
;
; If you already have a plugins.ini, just add the line for xbox_series.prx.

[default]
/data/GoldHEN/plugins/xbox_series.prx
